menu "C5VRX digital video tap"

config C5VRX_PARLIO_SAMPLE_CLOCK
    bool "Output PARLIO TX sample clock on GPIO2 (MTMS)"
    default n
    help
        Export the 40 MHz TX clock alongside the six DAC data pins for an
        external digital receiver. GPIO2 is reserved for the clock for this
        entire build; the sync flywheel and its observer are unavailable,
        regardless of the saved FLYWHEEL setting. The preference is preserved
        for normal builds. Data shifts on the falling edge; sample on rising.
        This is a 6-bit composite waveform, not decoded pixels or 8-bit video.
        Default off. Requires bench validation with the external receiver.

endmenu
